Package: aurora-sep-sk
Architecture: arm64
Depends: aurora-sep, openssh-client, systemd, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: OpenSSH security-key provider for Secure Enclave keys
 libaurora-sep-sk.so is an OpenSSH security-key provider. It makes ecdsa-sk
 keys whose private key is created in, and never leaves, this Mac's Secure
 Enclave (/dev/sep-key). Members of the sep-key group may create keys and
 sign with the handles they hold.
